# Red Team Critique v1 — Evidence Prosecution

**Run:** designing-for-2043-what-terminal-f-should-absorb-before-the-concrete-cures
**Reviewer:** evidence-prosecutor
**Target:** `outputs/stage2/strategist-draft-v1.md` (Strategist v1, 2026-08-19)
**Inputs:** run manifest, run prompt, all 12 selected briefs per manifest, `outputs/stage1/evidence-map.md`, `outputs/evidence-ledger.jsonl` (255 records), `outputs/stage1/quantitative-analysis/calculations.json`; one external verification (Dulles program figures, MWAA-sourced coverage).

